**Exploring small values.** Let me define F(r,c) = E(r,c)·r·c, so F(1,k)=F(k,1)=1. The recurrence becomes:

F(x+1,y+1)·F(x,y) − F(x,y+1)·F(x+1,y) = (x+1)(y+1)xy.

